+		/* WEDGE-DIAG: this is THE event under investigation, escalated from
+		 * DEBUG to ERROR so it shows in a session running synui without -d.
+		 *
+		 * associate() clears surface_id but NOT serial, so serial stays
+		 * non-zero for a window's entire associated lifetime. A re-map sends a
